title: 'statement-store: measure gossip latency between nodes in the zombienet benchmark'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    The statement store latency benchmark in zombienet measures delivery between nodes: each
    client subscribes to the topics of a neighbour on another node and reports the latency per
    message. The memory benchmark divides its rates by the measured time between scrapes.
crates:
- name: cumulus-zombienet-sdk-tests
  bump: none
